### Post Controller Tests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiBase = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/post

### Get all posts
GET {{apiBase}}/

### Get specific post by ID
# Replace with actual UUID from GET all posts response
GET {{apiBase}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Search posts with filters
GET {{apiBase}}/search?page=1&limit=10

### Search posts with query
GET {{apiBase}}/search?q=glib

### Search posts with tags
GET {{apiBase}}/search?tag=golang&tag=web

### Search posts with multiple filters
GET {{apiBase}}/search?q=kubernetes&tag=golang&page=1&limit=5

### Create a new post
POST {{apiBase}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My New Blog Post",
  "body": "This is the content of my blog post about Go programming and Glib framework.",
  "slug": "my-new-blog-post",
  "published": true,
  "author_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "tags": "golang,blogging,glib"
}

### Update a post
# Replace with actual UUID
PUT {{apiBase}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Post Title",
  "body": "This is the updated content.",
  "published": false
}

### Partial update (only title)
# Replace with actual UUID
PUT {{apiBase}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Only Title Changed"
}

### Delete a post
# Replace with actual UUID
DELETE {{apiBase}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Export posts as CSV
GET {{apiBase}}/export

### Stream posts via Server-Sent Events (SSE)
# This will stream 3 events, 1 second apart
GET {{apiBase}}/stream

### Health check endpoint (no middleware)
GET {{apiBase}}/health
